        when "en"
          [
            rule_section(:goal, "Building a library",
              "In Biblios, collect cards to lead in different library categories. Having many cards is not enough: only the winner of each category scores its victory points. Two to four players compete.",
              "First, take turns distributing cards to yourself, other players and a future auction pile. Then bid on the auction cards to improve your library, obtain gold or change how many points a category is worth."),
            rule_section(:cards, "Cards and category values",
